license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Two first-party open datasets documenting Parle: French Pronunciation:
  a bounded 35-entry beginner French sound inventory and a 120-mission
  A0-A2 speaking course map, plus a printable teacher-reference PDF and an open
  teaching pack with 35 audio clips, editable lesson plans, a bilingual learner
  worksheet, and answer key. The CSV files are unchanged from v2026.08.11. This
  is product documentation and open educational material, not an independent
  review, linguistic standard, assessment, certification, or endorsement.
